# Goth Rock — Research and Sources 2026-10-08

Checked **8 October 2026**. Opened sources unless explicitly marked as a search-only lead. No full books or recordings were consumed. This evidence base supports a starter project, not comprehensive history or ranked quality judgments.

- **[Beggars Banquet](https://beggarsbanquetrecords.com/bauhaus-in-the-flat-field/)** — In the Flat Field title and 1980 year; label catalog, exact-day conflict with other discographies.
- **[The Cure](https://www.thecure.com/release/pornography/)** — Pornography original year, tracks, credits; date differs by one day from official shop.
- **[The Cure EU shop](https://shopeu.thecure.com/pages/pornography-1982-extras-remastered-2005)** — Opened official shop: 3 May 1982 versus album page 4 May; exact day unresolved.
- **[The Cure biography](https://www.thecure.com/bio/)** — Artist-authored historical and stylistic context; not independent criticism.
- **[Guitar World](https://www.guitarworld.com/artists/guitarists/the-making-of-the-sisters-of-mercy-first-and-last-and-always)** — 11 May 2026 interview with Marx and Hussey: debut recording context and 1985 release; recollection and editorial framing distinguished.
- **[Reflection Black](https://reflectionblack.bandcamp.com/album/burning-obsidian-star)** — Released 20 March 2026; second album, 2023 debut, self-described styles; promotional quality claims not adopted.
- **[The Awakening](https://theawakeningofficial.bandcamp.com/album/the-lost-theatre)** — Released 23 August 2026; credits and thirteenth-album claim; tag boundaries need analysis.
- **[Mica](https://micaeternal.bandcamp.com/album/leave-my-body-somewhere-dark)** — Released 7 May 2026; debut-album statement, adjacent styles, earlier EPs.
- **[Black Doldrums](https://blackdoldrums.bandcamp.com/album/repetition-compulsion)** — Preorder, three preview tracks; explicit 13 November 2026 date supersedes October workaround; third album.
- **[Wikipedia overview](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gothic_rock)** — Opened secondary genre overview and bibliography; editable and unsuitable as sole evidence for disputed origins.

